/Title (The conference recognizes that technology alone cannot achieve sustainable development. Sustainable solutions require interdisciplinary research, responsible engineering, appropriate education and skills, environmental stewardship, innovation, policy support, and strong partnerships. UNESCO similarly emphasizes the important role of engineering in addressing challenges such as clean energy, resilient infrastructure, environmental sustainability, and the SDGs.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 774 0 R
/Prev 1410 0 R
